{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17464","headline":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 七 · 权德舆","name":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙月渐到窗前，移尊更就芳筵。\n轻吹乍摇兰烛，春光暗入花钿。\n丝竹偏宜静夜，绮罗共占韶年。\n不遣通宵尽醉，定知辜负风烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}